- Form 101 Control Valve (Globe / Butterfly CV): rows re-filed by block caption + heading (same label, different
  meaning per block), Max/Min value split, sheet 2 sizing lines, form 000 notes sheet, draft document number
- Form 701 Pressure Relief Valve: new reader — underline slots, sub-labels, 'A / B / C' items, unit slots
- Code 80 On/Off printed with the title block at the bottom + notes-only sheet 2 (Butterfly On/Off)
- project kind from the menu (?kind=globe|butterfly|psv -> '<project> · <Kind>'): Ball projects run exactly as
  before; other kinds get their own required-field list and skip Ball-only rules (n/a with the reason)
- datasheet family read from the sheet; a sheet put in another kind's menu is kept and the user is told
- tests/test_valve_kinds.py (synthetic forms, API rules, Ball unchanged, real samples via VALVE_KIND_SAMPLES)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
